  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS 2.04 or later, 68020 or later, and MUI 3.8 or later for the installed GUI",
    "Miami: assign from the shared S:User-Startup and ENV:MIAMI/GUI set to MUI",
    "The shipped default settings include unit 0 hardware profiles for DEVS:Networks/cnet.device and DEVS:Networks/3c589.device"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The two author archives supply the 68k main program, tools, guide, private libraries, tunnel devices, MNI modules, MUI modules and modem INF. MiamiDod comes from the archive member MiamiDoD.",
    "Checked BCWB inputs preserve the saved default profile, MUI selector, install log and eight installed icons, including the two ENVARC default app icons.",
    "The normal entry point is the MiamiDx tool icon in SYS:Internet/MiamiDx. The drawer also contains MiamiInit, MiamiRegister and the guide. The shared Internet and ENVARC:Sys drawers and the startup assign are system-owned.",
    "The archive's optional sanamni.device bridge is absent from the stock install. cnet.device and 3c589.device have separate ownership."
  ],
